{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは研究生として一緒に乃木坂46を支え、活動してきたりさこちゃん、きょうちゃん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/21/6793220/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わしづかみっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/21/6793220/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花冠♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと色んな事を教えたかったし、色んな物を一緒に見たかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強とお仕事の両立は本当に大変だと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、乃木坂入ったばかりなのに立派に代々木のステージを駆け抜け、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーも駆け抜け、沢山苦しかったり、楽しかったりあったと思うけど、二人はしっかりと乃木坂46をつくってくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46になってくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人が胸を張って自分の夢に向かって歩いて行く事をずっと応援しています！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/21/6793220/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃんが大好きだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいくて、クールで、でもおちゃめでちっちゃくて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は苦手で一人で行くのが嫌で、でもねねちゃんがいたから一緒に行ってくれたからちゃんと卒業出来ました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーLIVEで見た貴女の姿をずっと忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴女に貰った感動をずっと忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴女と創りあげてきた乃木坂46を必ずもっともっと大きくします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃん、りさこちゃん、きょうちゃん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEとか絶対来てねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初から最後までずっと乃木坂46です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変化しながら、でも変化しない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が言っていい立場じゃないけど。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別れもあるけど、道は続いて行きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂46を皆さんよろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃん、りさこちゃん、きょうちゃん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅立ちおめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈"}],"source":"archive"}